  <h1 id="GameFramework_Core_GameContext" data-uid="GameFramework.Core.GameContext" class="text-break">Class GameContext
  </h1>
  <div class="markdown level0 summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Core.GameContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Context object containing all core game services.
Uses constructor injection to receive all dependencies.
Provides centralized access to services for game states and other systems.</p>
</div>
